## Workspace conventions

| Path | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Shared agentic root | Path from VS Code `agentic-hub.sharedRoot` (default `~/.agentic`): skills, agents, rules |
| Project workspace | Your git root for the product you are building |
| Drafts / notes | Optional personal trees; keep product repos free of one-off scratch |

| Rule | Convention |
| --- | --- |
| Path writing in docs | Prefer home-relative paths like `~/project/` instead of machine-specific absolute paths |
| Symlinks | Use **Agentic Hub: Open Capability Manager** to enable skills/agents per tool; avoid manual links unless you accept overwrite risk |
